<title>LATVIA: TALSI FORESTRY MAKES 1996 LOSS.</title>
<headline>TALSI FORESTRY MAKES 1996 LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Talsi Forestry made a 1996 net loss of 130,788 lats on turnover of 311,274 lats, the stock exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>The bourse gave no comparative figures.</p>
<p>it said that the gross loss was 38,198 lats and the loss befre extraordinary items and taxes was 63,648 lats.</p>
<p>The company had assets of 603,651 lats, the bourse added.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
